# []C_ONTINUE applies only to a warning: an error raised by []S_IGNAL
# has no value to go on with, and continuing it is an error.
== SOURCE
'{ @ -> "a" []S_IGNAL "b" } []T_RAP '{ e -> []C_ONTINUE e }
== TYPE
Any a => a
== ERROR
error[not-resumable]: error[a] was raised by []S_IGNAL, not []W_ARN, so it has no value to go on with at 8..25
